25
00:01:11.850 --> 00:01:17.024
Wake up, Wake up! Get dressed, Get dressed! Breakfast, Breakfast!

26
00:01:17.324 --> 00:01:20.836
Go home, Go home! Go to bed, Go to bed!

27
00:01:21.136 --> 00:01:24.020
